# Recover the Farmland (Q327), the relics: a player on the quest with five brass trinket, five
# bronze mirror and five jade necklace pieces has Asha fail the tiara (a pinned 6 of 7) and restore
# the mirror and the necklace; Nestle trades the mirror for a scroll of resurrection (a pinned 59
# of 100) and the necklace for 90 D-grade spiritshots (50 plus a pinned 40), and has nothing for
# a missing tiara. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
